  "description": "Operating Area: Dubai, United Arab Emirates\n\nStep aboard the exquisite 85ft Duretti yacht and indulge in a world of refined luxury, where breathtaking views and unmatched comfort create the perfect setting for unforgettable moments on the waters of Dubai.\n\nThe Kronos yacht is thoughtfully designed for those with a taste for elegance and spaciousness. Boasting two expansive decks with open-air seating, guests can relax and soak in panoramic views of Dubai’s iconic skyline. Inside, the refined lounge features plush furnishings, a sophisticated dining space, and wide windows that flood the interior with natural light.\n\nFor restful retreats, the yacht offers four beautifully appointed cabins, each crafted to provide a peaceful and private haven. A fully equipped galley includes modern amenities such as an electric grill, microwave, and refrigerator, making onboard dining effortless and enjoyable. The advanced sound system sets the mood, perfect for celebrations or intimate gatherings.\n\nWith well-maintained washrooms and fresh towels at your disposal, every element has been thoughtfully arranged for your convenience. Your journey is overseen by a professional captain and supported by two skilled crew members, ensuring a seamless and memorable experience from start to finish.\n\nReserve your yacht experience in Dubai today.\n\nCruising Route\n2 Hours: Dubai Canal, Burj Al Arab\n3 Hours: Dubai Canal, Burj Al Arab, Palm Jumeirah, Atlantis\nFull day Route: Dubai Marina, Bluewaters Island,  Jumeirah Beach Residence, Atlantis the palm, Burj Al Arab,  Dubai world Islands, Dubai Canal, Burj Khalifa\n\nKnow Before You Go\n•\tAvailability: Daily from 6 AM to 11 PM. \n•\tArrival: Arrive 20 minutes before departure at the designated pick-up point.\n•\tIdentification: Bring your passport or local ID for verification.\n",
